        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer BB5100-045 4-1/2\" Half Mortise Hinge</b>\r\n<p>\r\nHalf Mortise Hinge - Door flange is mortised to door edge.  Jamb flange is surface applied to door jamb. For medium weight doors with average opening frequency. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nHalf mortise hinges are normally used when door is hung in a channel iron jamb.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications </b> for Bommer BB5100-045 Half Mortise Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Leaf Width: 2.062\"</li>\r\n<li>Jamb Leaf Width: 1.500\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Corners</li>\r\n<li>Gauge of Metal: .134\"</li>\r\n<li>Number of Holes: 7</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: 12-24FH x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: 12-24OH x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Steel </li>\r\n<li>Self Lubricating Bearings </li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>BHMA Certified <b>Grade 1</b> for 1 million cycles.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A8212</li>\r\n<li>Door flange mortise applied</li>\r\n<li>Jamb flange surface mounted to jamb</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 2</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BB5100-045.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer BB5100-045 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer Hinges made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Each (1 Hinge).</b>\r\n</p>",
